1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,697
I'm Eddie Zhang.
我是 Eddie Zhang。

2
00:00:04,297 --> 00:00:15,717
In the next ten minutes, I'll show you how a company of ten to two hundred people can run orders, stock, purchasing and quality from one record.
接下来十分钟，我给您看：一家十到两百人的公司，怎样用一份记录管好订单、库存、采购和质量。

3
00:00:16,117 --> 00:00:18,975
AI drafts. People decide.
AI 起草，人来决定。

4
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:25,860
Everything you'll see is a working replica, with a fictional company called Harbor Lane Supply.
下面看到的都是可以操作的复制品，用的是一家虚构的公司：Harbor Lane Supply。

5
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:33,640
Let's start with a Tuesday. A customer asks about a late order.
先说一个周二。客户问一张迟到的订单。

6
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:50,007
The facts exist. The order is in the ERP, the shortage is in a spreadsheet, the supplier's delay is in someone's inbox, and the failed inspection is on paper.
事实都在：订单在 ERP 里，缺料在表格里，供应商延期在某个人的邮箱里，检验不合格记在纸上。

7
00:00:51,607 --> 00:00:55,695
Nobody can see the chain. So you spend the morning on the phone.
可没人看得见这条链。于是一上午都在打电话。

8
00:00:58,415 --> 00:01:04,107
Every record lives in its own tool, owned by one person.
每份记录都在各自的工具里，归一个人管。

9
00:01:05,707 --> 00:01:10,887
We don't ask anyone to type things twice. We connect what you already have.
我们不让任何人重复录入，只把您已有的连起来。

10
00:01:13,607 --> 00:01:18,815
Two more pains. Audit week, when evidence is hunted down at the last minute.
还有两件头疼事。一是审核周，证据临时到处找。

11
00:01:20,415 --> 00:01:26,886
And the new AI tools. They are fast, but nobody can check where their answers came from.
二是新的 AI 工具：快是快，可谁也查不了它的答案从哪来。

12
00:01:29,606 --> 00:01:38,662
Here is the whole design. At the bottom, ERPNext, a mature open-source ERP, used as it is.
整个设计就这样。最底下是 ERPNext，成熟的开源 ERP，原样使用。

13
00:01:40,262 --> 00:01:46,875
On top, our operations hub, which reads it, connects it, and checks it.
上面是我们的运营中枢：读它、连它、查它。

14
00:01:49,595 --> 00:01:54,335
One rule runs through everything: AI drafts, people sign.
有一条规则贯穿始终：AI 起草，人签字。

15
00:01:55,935 --> 00:02:02,449
Ask the AI for a report, and it writes from your records, with citations.
让 AI 写报告，它照您的记录写，并注明出处。

16
00:02:04,049 --> 00:02:07,659
Ask it to sign, and it is refused. Every time.
让它签字？拒绝。每一次都拒绝。

17
00:02:10,379 --> 00:02:22,630
First, the base. An ERP is your single book of record: one list of items, customers and suppliers, and every transaction posted once.
先说底座。ERP 是公司唯一的账本：一份物料、客户、供应商清单，每笔业务只记一次。

18
00:02:24,230 --> 00:02:27,290
Ship one order, and watch what moves.
发一张货，看看什么跟着动。

19
00:02:30,010 --> 00:02:42,030
ERPNext already covers the whole company: accounting, stock, buying, selling, manufacturing, projects and more.
ERPNext 已经覆盖整个公司：会计、库存、采购、销售、生产、项目等等。

20
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:50,850
Accounting stays in ERPNext, where your accountant expects it.
会计留在 ERPNext 里，会计习惯的地方。

21
00:02:52,450 --> 00:03:02,590
Quality is where we add the most: ERPNext has basic inspections, and we add the full quality system on top.
质量是我们加得最多的：ERPNext 只有基本检验，我们在上面加了完整的质量体系。

22
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:08,250
Every document posts balanced entries.
每张单据都记一笔平衡的账。

23
00:03:09,850 --> 00:03:18,230
Receive the goods, pay the supplier, ship to the customer: stock and cost of goods move together.
收货、付供应商、发货给客户：库存和销货成本一起动。

24
00:03:19,830 --> 00:03:28,490
Invoice and get paid, and the books stay balanced. Your accountant and your warehouse finally read the same numbers.
开票、收款，账始终平衡。会计和仓库终于看的是同一组数。

25
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:33,230
Stock is a ledger too.
库存也是一本账。

26
00:03:34,830 --> 00:03:39,370
Every receipt and every shipment has a quantity and a value.
每次收货、每次发货，都有数量和金额。

27
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:44,390
And you can't ship what you don't have.
没有的货，发不出去。

28
00:03:47,110 --> 00:04:00,330
In practice, stock is kept by warehouse, with a quality hold kept apart from what you can sell. Batches and serial numbers are how a recall finds every customer.
实际用起来，库存按仓库分开，质量冻结的货和能卖的货分开放。批号和序列号，是召回时找到每一位客户的依据。

29
00:04:01,930 --> 00:04:11,300
When an item falls below its reorder level, one click drafts a purchase order. It waits for a person.
物料低于补货点，点一下就起草采购单。它等人来确认。

30
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:18,931
The ERP records. Our hub connects, measures and explains.
ERP 负责记录。我们的中枢负责连接、度量、解释。

31
00:04:20,531 --> 00:04:24,471
Changes become one connected picture of the business,
业务变动连成一张完整的图，

32
00:04:26,071 --> 00:04:32,451
metrics come with published formulas, anomalies come with their causes,
指标的公式公开，异常附带原因，

33
00:04:34,051 --> 00:04:38,850
and the fixes come back as drafts that a person confirms.
解决办法以草稿回来，由人确认。

34
00:04:41,570 --> 00:04:46,390
Every number has a published formula you can check by hand.
每个数都有公开的公式，可以自己手算核对。

35
00:04:47,990 --> 00:04:54,998
Change which orders count, and on-time delivery changes with them.
改一下计入哪些订单，准时交付率跟着变。

36
00:04:56,598 --> 00:05:04,098
And when there is no data, it says unknown. Never zero, never a guess.
没有数据时，它显示“未知”。不写零，也不猜。

37
00:05:06,818 --> 00:05:10,318
This is the morning dashboard. Every tile is clickable.
这是每天早上的看板。每一格都能点。

38
00:05:11,918 --> 00:05:20,340
Late orders, stock-outs, inventory, suppliers, quality: each one opens to the records behind it.
迟到订单、缺货、库存、供应商、质量，点开就是背后的记录。

39
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:24,638
Back to Tuesday.
回到那个周二。

40
00:05:26,238 --> 00:05:29,018
Click the late order and follow the chain:
点开迟到的订单，顺着链往下看：

41
00:05:30,618 --> 00:05:38,387
the item that's short, the purchase order that arrived late. What used to take a morning takes a minute.
缺的物料、迟到的采购单。过去要一上午，现在一分钟。

42
00:05:41,107 --> 00:05:43,167
The fix comes back as a draft:
解决办法以草稿的形式回来：

43
00:05:44,767 --> 00:05:48,391
a purchase order, or a note to the customer.
一张采购单，或一封给客户的说明。

44
00:05:49,991 --> 00:05:56,411
Nothing reaches ERPNext until a person clicks confirm.
人不点“确认”，什么也进不了 ERPNext。

45
00:05:59,131 --> 00:06:02,242
The assistant sits on every page.
助手在每一页都在。

46
00:06:03,842 --> 00:06:12,542
Ask which orders are late and why. It answers from your records, cites every one, and every run is logged.
问它哪些订单迟了、为什么。它照您的记录回答，每条都注明出处，每次运行都留记录。

47
00:06:15,262 --> 00:06:27,685
And for you, the owner: what you invoiced this week, who owes you, what's overdue and from whom, and what you owe next.
给老板看的：这周开了多少票，谁欠您钱，谁逾期了，接下来要付多少。

48
00:06:29,285 --> 00:06:39,430
It reads ERPNext's own invoices, so these numbers match your accountant's to the cent.
它读的就是 ERPNext 里的发票，所以和会计的数一分不差。

49
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:55,290
Quality is where most small companies drown. Here, a standard like ISO 9001 or 13485 becomes checks that read your actual records every day.
质量是多数小公司最吃力的地方。在这里，ISO 9001、13485 这样的标准变成每天读取实际记录的检查。

50
00:06:56,890 --> 00:07:04,433
Green means today's records satisfy it. Red names the exact record that doesn't.
绿色：今天的记录满足要求；红色：直接指出是哪一条不满足。

51
00:07:07,153 --> 00:07:10,333
A nonconformance follows its workflow.
不合格品按流程走。

52
00:07:11,933 --> 00:07:13,630
Contain it, sign it.
先隔离，签字。

53
00:07:15,230 --> 00:07:17,304
Propose a disposition.
提出处置意见。

54
00:07:18,904 --> 00:07:27,759
Try to approve your own disposition: refused. Someone else must approve, and the history can only grow.
想自己批自己的处置？拒绝。必须由另一个人批，记录只增不改。

55
00:07:30,479 --> 00:07:32,216
At incoming inspection,
来料检验时，

56
00:07:33,816 --> 00:07:43,038
type a reading out of tolerance, and it turns red at once. The verdict comes from code, not from the AI.
输入一个超差读数，立刻变红。判定由程序给出，不由 AI 决定。

57
00:07:45,758 --> 00:07:49,088
Signed inspections feed the control charts.
签过字的检验数据进入控制图。

58
00:07:50,688 --> 00:07:57,548
When the process shifts, a point turns red before bad parts pile up,
工序一偏，点就变红，赶在废品堆起来之前，

59
00:07:59,148 --> 00:08:04,447
and one click opens a nonconformance report from the signal.
点一下就从这个信号开出不合格报告。

60
00:08:07,167 --> 00:08:08,307
For medical devices,
医疗器械，

61
00:08:09,907 --> 00:08:19,087
scan the label: the device identifier, lot and expiry are read and checked,
扫一下标签：器械标识、批号、有效期读出来并校验，

62
00:08:20,687 --> 00:08:22,947
then traced to every shipment.
再追到每一次发货。

63
00:08:25,667 --> 00:08:30,687
A supplier warns that a lot of boxes may be bad.
供应商提醒：有一批纸箱可能有问题。

64
00:08:32,287 --> 00:08:38,359
Trace it forward: the lots that used it, the deliveries, the customers.
往下追：用了它的生产批、发出的货、收货的客户。

65
00:08:39,959 --> 00:08:45,339
Start a mock recall from the same screen, and record who confirmed.
在同一个画面发起模拟召回，记下谁确认的。

66
00:08:48,059 --> 00:08:57,081
Measuring machines send their files straight in. Each reading lands on the right part and feature, and a person accepts it.
测量设备的文件直接导入。每个读数落到对应的零件和项目上，由人接收。

67
00:08:59,801 --> 00:09:04,150
Machines connect too, each with its own key.
设备也能接进来，每台有自己的钥匙。

68
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:09,650
A reading from a machine lands in an inbox and waits.
设备发来的读数先进收件箱，等着。

69
00:09:11,250 --> 00:09:19,710
A person accepts it, and it joins the inspection, marked as coming from that machine. A machine never signs.
人接收后，它才进入检验记录，并标明来自哪台设备。设备永远不签字。

70
00:09:22,430 --> 00:09:32,970
And this is where it leads: a factory where the warehouse, the robots, vision inspection and every gauge feed one hub.
这就是它通向的地方：仓库、机器人、视觉质检、每一件量具，都汇入同一个中枢。

71
00:09:35,690 --> 00:09:47,651
At the inspection station, vision reads each part's code, measures it against the drawing, and quarantines the bad ones automatically.
质检站上，视觉系统读每个零件的码，按图纸测量，不合格的自动隔离。

72
00:09:50,371 --> 00:10:04,060
The measuring machine, a five-axis scanner, the roughness tester and every hand gauge report in by themselves. A gauge past its calibration date is refused.
三坐标、五轴扫描仪、粗糙度仪和每一把手持量具，都自己报数。过了校准期的量具，读数不收。

73
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:11,880
The loop closes with a person approving at the key step.
闭环里，关键一步由人确认。

74
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:18,260
That's a vision, and every step toward it runs on the same record.
这是愿景；而通往它的每一步，都跑在同一份记录上。

75
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:32,942
It's yours to run. ERPNext is open source with no per-user licences, the platform runs on a server you control, and your data stays yours.
平台归您自己运行：ERPNext 是开源的，不按人头收许可费；平台装在您掌控的服务器上，数据归您。

76
00:10:34,542 --> 00:10:39,814
We teach your people, and we offer hosted connections when you need them.
我们教会您的人，需要时提供托管接口服务。

77
00:10:42,534 --> 00:10:48,975
Don't switch everything at once. Import your data, and put one module live,
不用一次全换。先导入数据，上线一个模块，

78
00:10:50,575 --> 00:10:56,608
usually incoming inspection or nonconformance. Then grow.
通常是来料检验或不合格品。再一步步扩。

79
00:10:59,328 --> 00:11:02,992
One record. AI drafts. People decide.
一份记录，AI 起草，人来决定。

80
00:11:04,592 --> 00:11:12,971
We're inviting a small number of pilot companies. If that Tuesday sounded familiar, let's talk.
我们正在邀请少数试点企业。如果那个周二听着耳熟，我们聊聊。
